'''Thunderblood Axe''' is a version of [[Nord Axe]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[slash]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is a slow but powerful overhead swing, ''perfect'' for removing tree stumps that are too low to hit with a normal swing.

An upgraded Nord Axe will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Axe.

