* Thunderblood Axe can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Bloodgold Battle Idol]].
* Thunderblood Axe, as of patch  1.0.20, does a full 3-part attack swing even against trees, making it the fastest tree felling axe in the game.  This may be a bug.

